# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Files that must never reach the public site.
#
# Found 2026-08-16: 24 internal markdown documents were being served
# live at https://londoneducation.pk/<name>.md with HTTP 200. Among
# them, docs/marketing-playbook.md exposed the internal-only monthly
# fee structure — which site policy keeps off every public surface —
# and the audit/report files exposed ad spend, CPL, competitor
# analysis, and growth strategy.
#
# Vercel never uploads anything matched here, so these stay in git for
# the team while being absent from the deployment entirely. This is a
# stronger guarantee than robots.txt, which only asks crawlers not to
# index; the files were still readable by anyone with the URL.
#
# The blog is pure HTML and nothing at runtime reads markdown, so
# excluding *.md is safe. Keep docs/*.pdf deployable — the franchise
# application form is meant to be downloaded.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

*.md
reports/
audit-2026-04-25/

# Dev-only content API server. The Vercel site is fully static.
server.py
